# Purpose
Helps users write issue reports with a short title, clear problem statement, and
location details.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with a short title.
- State the problem clearly.
- Include where the issue appears.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Separate observed behavior from suspected cause unless evidence is available.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
